# M2's wake timer on the paused clock, through the page's own tip since M7: the pointer rests on
# k's number box (330, 452.5, 107, 32 at 1440 x 900), and the rest's 400 ms SDL timer wakes the
# idle loop. Every frame from the move: the row lights one frame after the move, and k's tip
# ("Drag sideways · Shift for fine · double-click: back to 0") shows on the first frame after its
# deadline, the same frame on every surface (a paused main loop resumes on the next animation
# frame after the timer). The page waits 2 s first, as M6's states do, so React's plane has
# finished its first paint.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 383 468
frames tip every 16 for 480
